{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲版较清楚地解释了急迫为何在148小节后退下、身体先松开而问题仍在，以及愿望如何因此浮现、重新感到亲近又如何因意识到它可能流逝而转生急切，并进一步说明从抓取转向观看为何不是放弃而会改变他对珍惜与失去的承受方式；较需谨慎的是把“眼前这一刻正在过去”以及“不愿总靠承受维持在乎”等动机说得较具体，虽有解释力，却不是听感记录直接确证的事实。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙版清楚建立了强撑失效、抵抗暂歇、愿望不再立即被压回、想念逐渐完整并推动重新连接的因果链，也保留了愿望没有回应的未完成感；但身体先于念头的变化仍主要停留在体力耗尽、强硬无以为继的概括层面，而且没有具体展开约160小节旧家园的闪现，以及从抓取转向观看这一应对方式如何反过来改变当下感受。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"甲 版不差于 乙 版\",\n  \"why\": \"甲版的优势不只是叙述更完整，而是把身体松动、压抑解除、亲近感重新浮现、急切再度生成及放轻抓取对感受的反作用连成了较具体的机制链，尽管部分心理动机属于合理推演而非听感记录所能直接证实。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8dca3753-6eef-4f5f-bf94-8a23a9f55d3e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T135244453382Z", "elapsed_seconds": 95.187, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:54:19.640805+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "798591d145d2bdccd4af13adfddaedd3846cbb9369dd349ee767a91db5a99b6f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1e